{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-31", "prepared_on": "2026-10-31", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-31</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic expected to receive high 'junk' rating from credit agencies following IPO, FT report says<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">《金融時報》：Anthropic 上市後恐獲信評機構給予高度「垃圾級」評等</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Blackstone forecasts that Anthropic will get a high junk rating after its IPO. That would make it harder and costlier to raise the money behind its heavy spending.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Blackstone 預測 Anthropic 上市後將獲得偏高的垃圾級評等，會讓支撐其龐大支出的籌資更困難、成本更高。這目前只是預測。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/30/anthropic-expected-to-receive-high-junk-rating-from-credit-agencies-following-ipo-report-says/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic VS Code extension on Cursor backdoored for nearly 12 hours<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 在 Cursor 上的 VS Code 擴充套件遭植入後門近 12 小時</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's extension on Cursor was backdoored for nearly 12 hours. It is still unknown how attackers got into Anthropic's verified Cursor account.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 的 Cursor 擴充套件被植入後門長達近 12 小時。攻擊者如何取得其已驗證帳號，目前仍不明。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/10/anthropic-vs-code-extension-on-cursor-backdoored-for-nearly-12-hours/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> The biggest names in AI are backing a new way to opt out of scraping<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 大廠共同支持新的「拒絕爬取」標準</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI, Google, Microsoft and Anthropic say they will adopt a new standard for publishers to opt out of AI scraping. Publishers can set their AI training preferences once across multiple companies.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI、Google、微軟與 Anthropic 將採用新標準，出版商只要設定一次，就能向多家 AI 公司表達是否同意用於訓練。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1023763/openai-google-microsoft-ai-scraping-standard-opt-out\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Apple Intelligence is finally coming to China with iOS 27.3<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Apple Intelligence 終於隨 iOS 27.3 登陸中國</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple announced on its Chinese newsroom site that Apple Intelligence will launch in China with iOS 27.3. The features arrive first in a beta due November 4th.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Apple 在中國官網宣布，Apple Intelligence 將隨 iOS 27.3 在中國推出，11 月 4 日先釋出測試版，正式版隨後推出。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1023974/apple-intelligence-china-ios-27-3\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Google's first data center satellite is online and writing poetry<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 首顆資料中心衛星上線，開始寫詩</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The first TPU in space is running a Google DeepMind Gemma 4 model. Its first response from orbit was a haiku about being in space.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">太空中的第一顆 TPU 正在執行 Google DeepMind 的 Gemma 4 模型，並從軌道上回傳第一個回應：一首關於太空的俳句。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/30/googles-first-data-center-satellite-is-online-and-writing-poetry/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Mistral Says Its AI Model 'Le Chonk' Has Leapfrogged China in the Open-Weight Race<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Mistral 稱「Le Chonk」模型在開放權重競賽中超越中國模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The French lab claims its latest release matches or beats the best models from DeepSeek and Z.ai in coding and cybersecurity.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這家法國 AI 實驗室宣稱，新模型在程式設計與資安任務上追平甚至超越 DeepSeek 與 Z.ai 的最佳模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/mistral-says-le-chonk-surpasses-chinese-models-cybersecurity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Cracks are emerging in the AI spending boom<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 投資熱潮出現裂痕</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Big Tech is pouring billions into AI infrastructure, but mounting debt, negative cash flow and investor skepticism raise doubts about how long the boom can last.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">科技巨頭砸下數十億美元建設 AI 基礎設施，但債務攀升、現金流轉負與投資人疑慮，讓這波熱潮能否持續受到質疑。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/30/cracks-are-emerging-in-the-ai-spending-boom/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Linux TCP flaw can give remote root access; some distros still unpatched<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Linux TCP 漏洞可被用來遠端取得 root 權限，部分發行版尚未修補</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CVE-2026-98432 affects IPv4 TCP handling in the Linux kernel. On October 27 Anthropic published a proof that it can run commands as root against servers with an MPTCP listener, with no login needed. Upstream is patched, but distro updates vary.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Linux 核心 CVE-2026-98432 影響 IPv4 TCP 連線處理。Anthropic 於 10/27 公開驗證，對有 MPTCP 監聽服務的伺服器，不需登入就能以 root 執行命令。上游已修補，但各發行版進度不一。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180101\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> DoorDash said it's only received 'several hundred' orders from AI agents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">DoorDash：來自 AI 代理的訂單僅「數百筆」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">DoorDash says outside AI agents have placed only several hundred orders so far. It says it is open to working with third-party agent makers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">DoorDash 表示，外部 AI 代理至今只下了數百筆訂單，並說明願意與第三方代理開發商合作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/30/doordash-said-its-only-received-several-hundred-orders-from-ai-agents/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Pope Leo calls for the disarmament of AI: 'Machines are tools, not persons'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">教宗良十四世呼籲讓 AI「解除武裝」：機器是工具，不是人</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">In his Papal Address, Pope Leo XIV said AI systems should be \"disarmed\" and urged UN member states to take concrete steps toward banning lethal autonomous weapons.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">教宗良十四世在演說中表示 AI 系統應被「解除武裝」，並呼籲聯合國會員國採取具體行動，禁止致命自主武器。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1023188/pope-leo-disarm-ai\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}